  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut carrot and zucchini into bite-sized chunks and place on the lined oven tray. Season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66908b8bba3419004e45a50f-1a8333ec.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, melt the butter with a dash of olive oil, in a medium saucepan over medium heat.\n• Add basmati rice, the water (for the rice) and a generous pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to low and cover with a lid. Cook for 10 mins, then remove from heat and keep covered until rice is tender and the water absorbed, 10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66908b8bba3419004e45a50f-4d99a55e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While rice is cooking, drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas until softened, 2-3 mins.\n• Add ginger paste, curry spice blend, masala spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Stir in coconut milk, the stock powder and the water (for the curry) and simmer until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.\n• Remove from heat and stir through roast veggies and baby spinach until wilted and combined. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66908b8bba3419004e45a50f-0380ff2c.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide rice and Indian veggie-packed chickpea curry between bowls.\n• Top with yoghurt and flaked almonds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66908b8bba3419004e45a50f-4f46fe13.jpeg"
    }
  ]
